# Build-context ignore file for the ldns-MTL signer image.
#
# The repository-wide .dockerignore keeps the viewer image context small and
# excludes third_party/ entirely. This builder needs the pinned liboqs and
# libMTL submodules, so it carries its own ignore file (BuildKit honours
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile) with the same exclusions
# minus third_party/.
target
dist
.git
data
.mtl-install
environment.json
**/*.log
*.pdf
